SY_TALK("GNXpqu4v4sI",[[48,["First Public Program","Sydney, Australia"]],[66,["16th March, 1990"]],[79,["I bow to all the seekers of truth."]],[132,["You have to know that truth is what it is.","We cannot conceptualize it with our human"]],[152,["awareness. We cannot order it, we cannot manipulate","it, we cannot organize it. It is what it is,"]],[164,["has been and will be. And what is the truth?","Truth is that we are surrounded or we are"]],[177,["penetrated or we are nourished, looked after","and loved by a very subtle energy which is"]],[189,["the energy of divine love. The second truth","is that we are not this body, this mind, these"]],[206,["conditionings, this ego, but we are the spirit.","You don’t have to accept what I’m saying"]],[220,["blindly, because blind faith leads to fanaticism.","But as scientists you must keep your minds"]],[230,["open and see for yourself what I’m saying:","if it is so, honestly you must accept it."]],[246,["We know so much through science about our","civilization, our advancement. This is the"]],[262,["advancement of a tree which has grown outside","very much; but if we do not know our roots,"]],[273,["we’ll be destroyed. So it is important to","know about our roots. And this is what it"]],[285,["is that I would say are our roots."]],[290,["As you can see, there are seven centers within","us, and these subtle centers are placed in"]],[314,["the spinal cord and the brain. These cater","to our physical, mental, emotional and spiritual"]],[325,["needs. On the physical side they manifest","the energy for the use of our plexuses which"]],[336,["look after our physical problems. That is","on the right side, the energy which is supplied"]],[351,["by this yellow line, a subtle channel – we","call it as the Pingala Nadi – this supplies"]],[363,["energy for our physical and mental actions.","So this is the power of action within us which"]],[374,["also caters to the right sympathetic nervous","system. The another channel you see on the"]],[383,["left-hand side is the channel by which we","desire, put our energy to our desire. So this"]],[393,["is the power of desire and looks after our","emotions. This is the one which looks after"]],[403,["our conditionings also. At the end of these","two channels they create two institutions:"]],[415,["one on the right side crosses over, and the","yellow balloon that you see is the ego, is"]],[422,["the balloon of ego that we have; and the left-hand","side one that, which conditions our mind is"]],[431,["the balloon of superego. As we start growing,","in age by the time we are twelve years of"]],[440,["age, these two completely meet and the soft","bone in our head becomes completely calcified."]],[454,["Now there’s third energy within us which","is in the center, and this central energy"]],[468,["is the one which has made us human beings.","And these centers are the milestones of our"]],[479,["evolution. So now the last jumping is left","out. It has reached up to the limbic area."]],[492,["Now, only thing, it has to break through the","soft bone in the, on the head and break through"]],[512,["that, which is the actualization of baptism.","Baptism is not an artificial thing – it"]],[524,["is an actualization. But the energy that does","it is, we call it sleeping energy, in the"]],[538,["triangular bone called as sacrum. That means","the Greeks knew that this is a sacred bone,"]],[548,["that they called it “sacrum.” This energy","has to rise and break through that fontanel"]],[556,["bone area and connect us to that subtle divine","Power which we have never felt during human"]],[566,["awareness. Thus we get connected to this divine","Power, and we start feeling it on our fingertips."]],[585,["It’s described in the Koran that “at the","time of resurrection your hands will speak,"]],[593,["and they will give witness against you.”","That is, you start feeling your own centers"]],[599,["– these are five, six and seven centers","– and they indicate what’s wrong with"]],[605,["you within yourself, what’s the problem.","Also you can feel the cool breeze coming out"]],[617,["of your head, cool breeze of the Holy Ghost.","Because this sleeping power which is called"]],[624,["as the kundalini – “kundala” means “coils”","– is the power of pure desire within us."]],[639,["[Disturbance by a man in the audience]"]],[648,["What’s he talking? Ah …. This is the result,","you know, of tensions, on modern tensions."]],[663,["So many such things are happening. People","have no peace. That’s what I say, the tree"]],[671,["has outgrown itself: it must find its roots.","In America they say there are fifty-five per"]],[681,["cent people who suffer from terrible nervousness,","and at least thirty per cent people have got"]],[689,["schizophrenia. It’s a very dangerous thing.","If we don’t understand how delicately we"]],[703,["are made and to realize that we are human","beings, the epitome of evolution, we are going"]],[712,["to land in great difficulties. We may try","to run away from reality, but reality will"]],[720,["have an effect on us."]],[723,["Now, so now we have this kind of a mechanism","within us existing. Now this is a living process"]],[734,["of evolution, and you must understand that","we don’t pay for living process, and we"]],[744,["can’t even explain it; because when you","take a small little seed and put it in the"]],[752,["Mother Earth, it germinates by itself spontaneously.","You don’t pay to the Mother Earth anything."]],[762,["And when it germinates, it grows into a tree","and produces thousands of seeds. So in that"]],[771,["little seed the map of all the things it was","going to create is there. How it works, we"]],[782,["never ask this question. We take all the things","for granted. We don’t even ask the question"]],[789,["how this wonderful eye of ours is made like","a camera, and that how we are programmed within"]],[796,["ourselves like computers. You see this is","the color; you don’t have to think about"]],[804,["– it’s there. Through our sensory organs,","how we find out things: we’d never question"]],[813,["it. But to answer now all our questions, we","have to become the divine computer. And that’s"]],[828,["why we have to be connected to the mains,","I call them, as the people who are self-realized,"]],[836,["the people who have got their spirit in their","attention."]],[846,["When the attention is enlightened through","this happening, then you can see the absolute"]],[856,["truth. Like supposing you are holding on to","a snake and there’s darkness, and somebody"]],[865,["tells, there is darkness, “But you have","got a snake in your hand. I can see it.”"]],[873,["He’ll say, “No, I think it is a rope.”","Now if you put on the light, immediately that"]],[882,["person will drop. In the same way, when the","attention gets enlightened by the spirit,"]],[890,["the first nature, innate nature of the spirit","is that it manifests absolute truth. You immediately"]],[900,["become so empowered that you give up all those","habits which are destructive to your life"]],[907,["– immediately. I have seen people giving","up drugs overnight in London, alcoholism,"]],[913,["all kinds of things. I was amazed the way","it’s working."]],[921,["It’s your own power within you; it just","there, is existing. There’s no obligation"]],[934,["of any kind, it’s just one enlightened candle","can enlighten another candle. That’s how"]],[941,["it works. And it has to work – otherwise,","as I told you, we are standing on the brink"]],[948,["of destruction. Leave alone things like drugs","and things we take to escape reality, there"]],[956,["are so many diseases that have come up and","coming up that it is going to be very difficult"]],[967,["for us to exist on this Mother Earth after","some time: ecological problems, the uncertainty"]],[979,["of life, the insecurities that are built within","us. So many conditionings we have. How to"]],[989,["get rid of them? How to be cleansed is a very","big problem today. And for that I think it"]],[997,["is important that we have to get our Self-realization."]],[1004,["We talk, “my, my body, my hand, my mind,","my ego” – but which is this “my”?"]],[1014,["Which is the “I” behind it? And when doctors","also talk about the autonomous nervous system,"]],[1020,["they don’t say what is this auto, who is","this auto. We say “automobile” – so"]],[1025,["there is a driver sitting driving the car.","But who is driving this car? That is what"]],[1034,["we have to find out. And that auto is the","spirit within us. Unless and until the connection"]],[1043,["with the Divine is established, all other","efforts are really fruitless. And that’s"]],[1051,["why many people ask Me why all the religions","are fighting among themselves, why people"]],[1057,["who believe in God are fighting among themselves;","why they are so sinful, why aren’t they"]],[1064,["so good. The reason is, they have not found","the truth as yet. Just believing in any God"]],[1072,["or being born in any religion doesn’t make","you a righteous person at all: anybody following"]],[1079,["any religion can commit any sin. There’s","no bondage."]],[1084,["But when this kundalini rises into that green","part, as you see – we call it as a Void:"]],[1090,["is the area which is like a bridging. Very","significant it is, like Moses bridged; in"]],[1097,["the same way, this is the bridging. And this","bridging, when it takes place you can cross"]],[1104,["over this ocean of illusion, as we say. But","actually this ocean of illusion is representing"]],[1114,["our ten valencies within us. We have ten valencies,","ten dharmas, ten – our innate nature as"]],[1124,["human beings. So when kundalini rises into","this area, it enlightens this area, and a"]],[1132,["person who is a realized soul doesn’t do","anything wrong. He doesn’t cheat, he doesn’t"]],[1138,["bribes, he’s not frightened. He’s so courageous,","he’s so compassionate, he’s so dynamic,"]],[1144,["he’s so loving. This is only possible when","you are innately religious. Unless and until"]],[1156,["that happens, the religion outside, the man-made","religion, cannot give you what it is promising"]],[1163,["you. And that’s why people are surprised","that there is a big difference between the"]],[1168,["practice and precepts of religion."]],[1171,["Every religion has said that “you seek your","Self.” So there was nothing wrong with all"]],[1178,["the prophets, incarnations, all the saints.","They all said the same thing. But we have"]],[1189,["missed the point. Everything has become either","money-oriented or is an intellectual, intellectual"]],[1197,["probing. It is through intellectual probing","you reach a point where you realize that you"]],[1205,["have not reached the reality. So what should","we do? And this is a very great gift of modern"]],[1216,["times which was promised long time back. Is","described already in our Puranas that at the"]],[1224,["time, these modern times called as Kali Yuga,","the Paramachaitanya or this all-pervading"]],[1231,["Power will become active – means there is","Krita Yuga, it will become active – and"]],[1239,["through it thousands of people will get their","realization. Even in the Bible they have said"]],[1249,["that it’s quite a limited number. John the","– John has written in his “Revelation”"]],[1255,["it’s quite a limited number, but we have","already crossed that."]],[1262,["And so many people have to become realized","souls. It’s very important today, and it’s"]],[1271,["so easy – Sahaja. “Saha” is “with”,","“ja” is “born.” Born with you is the"]],[1277,["right to become one with the Divine, united","with the Divine – that is yoga. “Yoga”"]],[1286,["is nothing but to be united with that divine","Power. That’s what yoga is; all other things"]],[1295,["are subsidiary."]],[1298,["This union brings forth new dimensions on","our central nervous system. As a evolution,"]],[1309,["we always develop a new dimension. By this","you develop a new awareness of collective"]],[1320,["consciousness, by which you can feel other","people, their centers. Sitting down here you"]],[1329,["can feel the center of somebody – somebody","who is dead, even you can feel his centers"]],[1335,["and find out what he was: was he a realized","soul or not? You can find out about anybody"]],[1341,["whether he was a realized soul or not, sitting","down here. You have to just think about him,"]],[1345,["put your hands. If you are a realized soul","you can feel on your fingertips what is the"]],[1349,["problem. And somehow if you know how to correct","those problems, you get rid of your own diseases"]],[1359,["and the diseases of others, your own problems","and the problems of others."]],[1367,["First you enter into a state of mind which","we call as “thoughtless awareness.” When"]],[1376,["you cross this center of Agnya that is placed","in the optic chiasma, you become thoughtlessly"]],[1383,["aware. You are aware, but there is no thought.","What a blessing it is! Say, I see a carpet"]],[1393,["here, it’s beautiful, and when I look at","it if I start thinking “what a good carpet!”"]],[1398,["If it is Mine it’s a very big headache because","I’ll be thinking, “I hope it goes home,"]],[1402,["is already insured, is not lost, is not spoilt”","– all kinds of worries about this carpet."]],[1409,["Thank God it’s not Mine, so I’ll look","at it, still I start thinking how much I should"]],[1415,["pay to get it, from where can I get it; all","these thoughts coming."]],[1420,["But if I look at it without any thoughts,","then the joy of its creation, to whomsoever"]],[1429,["it may belong, so-called, starts pouring on","Me like beautiful flow of joy. Whatever the"]],[1445,["artist has put into it, all his joy starts","pouring, that peace and that joyous feeling"]],[1455,["within Me when I don’t think about it. Thinking","makes a person mad, creates lots of problems."]],[1464,["Too much thinking is wasteful, also. As I’ll","tell you about the second center we have here,"]],[1473,["tomorrow, about the second center, that by","thinking, how many diseases you get."]],[1479,["The other day I was in a radio station and","the gentleman was asking Me, “How can I"]],[1491,["get rid of my diabetes? You say that by thinking","it happens.”"]],[1494,["I said, “Yes.” Because in India if they","have to take tea in a village, the sugar is"]],[1503,["put so much that the spoon must stand at right","angle! And nobody gets diabetes. But people"]],[1514,["who are sedentary, planning too much – I","mean mostly, say, bureaucrats, diplomats,"]],[1524,["politicians – they are very vulnerable.","What is the reason for that, which I’ll"]],[1531,["explain to you tomorrow, how we get all these","diseases because we think too much and we"]],[1536,["cannot stop thinking."]],[1542,["But so far, we have to understand that we","are all on the, either on the right side or"]],[1551,["on the left side. We are not in the center.","The centers are like this, I would say: the"]],[1560,["left and the right, and the left side and","the right side join together to make the center."]],[1568,["Now supposing you are right-sided – means","you are using too much of your physical or"]],[1572,["mental aptitudes, you are planning for future,","you are very futuristic – then this starts"]],[1581,["extracting energy from this center and starts","moving to the left, right, starts moving to"]],[1588,["the right. At the same time if something happens","on the left side and you get a jerk, it is"]],[1597,["broken. Then you are vulnerable to diseases","which we call as psychosomatic, because this"]],[1605,["is the one is the somatic and this is the","psycho. And these diseases cannot be cured."]],[1618,["Because if somebody’s a doctor then he doesn’t","know about psychology; somebody is psychologist,"]],[1625,["he doesn’t know the medicine. I mean, we","have doctors for one eye and another doctor"]],[1629,["for another eye! We have gone to that limit","of specialization."]],[1633,["This is the science of integration. Is not","a science of specialization but integration,"]],[1645,["because this is one body which has got the","nose, eyes, ears all stuck to one body. And"]],[1653,["this is one personality, and we have to deal","with this personality as a whole. But if you"]],[1660,["start treating it like one for the nose, one","for the ears, it’s not going to work out."]],[1667,["So when this kundalini rises through these","centers it brings them back to normal, to"]],[1674,["the balance, integrates them one with another","and connects them with the mains from where"]],[1684,["the energy flows inside. And that’s how","you become very dynamic, you don’t get tired,"]],[1693,["you feel very young, you never feel your age;","and you are extremely compassionate and kind,"]],[1705,["and you love to do good to others."]],[1710,["It is so much I have to tell you. Now Sahaja","Yoga is working in forty nations, and working"]],[1719,["out very well. The most surprising place was","USSR. And now the people are saying, “Mother,"]],[1726,["You have been working for twenty years in","the West and only went last year to USSR,"]],[1731,["and You have more Sahaja yogis there than","You have all over the world.” Not in India:"]],[1737,["we have many more, of course, because they","know about it, they were not ignorant, so"]],[1741,["it’s all right – if you forget India.","I don’t know what’s so special about them"]],[1748,["that they could see this so clearly."]],[1752,["And one of the snags of Sahaja Yoga is that","you cannot pay for it. And this really is"]],[1760,["the very great snag, I think, because a gentleman","from BBC in England told Me that Anglo-Saxon"]],[1767,["brain cannot understand anything that can","be done without money. I said, “Who has"]],[1774,["made this brain, God or somebody else?”","It’s very surprising! And even in, I went"]],[1783,["to Toronto – no, Boston – and they said,","“How many Rolls-Royces You’ve got?”"]],[1788,["I said, “I have none, because I don’t","take any money. Whatever I have is of My husband’s.”"]],[1795,["They said, “Then we are not interested.","You have to be in the business.”"]],[1800,["It’s very shocking, this kind of a attitude","towards Divine. I said, “How much money"]],[1808,["did you pay to Christ?”"]],[1815,["Today also there was a question from a radio,","and they asked Me, “You don’t take any"]],[1822,["money; then how do You travel?”"]],[1824,["I said, “So far, for quite some time I was","travelling with My husband’s money, no doubt."]],[1831,["But now we have so many Sahaja yogis and they","have some self-respect, and they don’t pay"]],[1837,["Me, they pay to the travel agents, not to","Me. They don’t want I to pay for them – then"]],[1845,["tomorrow will say ‘all right, You pay for","our food also!’” I mean, any self-respecting"]],[1850,["people can understand that. So if somebody","does not take money, they go to that limit"]],[1857,["that even I should pay for their salvation,","coming to their place I should pay for the"]],[1866,["hall, I should pay for everything. This kind","of a brain – oh, it’s not all, all of"]],[1873,["you are not Anglo-Saxon, I hope so! – I","can’t understand. And that’s why it has"]],[1884,["not come up to the point where it should have."]],[1885,["On the contrary, I must say Russians are very","brave people. With the war they have become"]],[1900,["very strong. On the contrary, in other countries","I have seen with the war they have become"]],[1907,["very nervous, very frightened. And immediately","they took to Sahaja Yoga for one point, that"]],[1916,["you cannot pay for it. They could see it,","that you can’t pay because it’s a living"]],[1923,["process. Is such a wisdom that clicked. You","won’t believe, in England I was fighting"]],[1934,["with seven hippies for four years: the questions,","the bombardment and – too much! I was about"]],[1942,["to give up. They just thought that it’s","something to be attacked. And that’s the"]],[1953,["reason they attacked all the saints, all the","incarnations and all the prophets."]],[1964,["But I hope now everybody realizes that we","are in trouble. We are all in trouble. We"]],[1972,["don’t know what’s going to happen next","day. We might get into cancer, might get into"]],[1978,["some other trouble. We might have any problem","that we do not know about. We are not sure"]],[1986,["of our future. So it is better that we get","our special energy that is within us, we get"]],[1994,["ourselves enlightened and take to something","that will make us much wiser, healthier, joyous"]],[2006,["and knowledgeable. “Knowledge” does not","mean what you know through your brains, but"]],[2012,["on your central nervous system."]],[2014,["That’s what everybody said, that the time","has come – it’s a blossom time, I call"]],[2025,["it. There are thousands and thousands who","can get realization. It’s such a great blessing"]],[2032,["that we could have en masse realization. On","the Tree of Life there would have been only"]],[2039,["one or two flowers to begin with, but today","I call it a blossom time. Is actually the"]],[2047,["Day of Judgment, but “blossom time” seems","better to say – is more promising. I hope"]],[2057,["tonight we all will get realization and enjoy","ourselves. May God bless you all."]],[2076,["I would like you to ask Me some questions,","because today is a first day. I’m sorry,"]],[2082,["the mike was not all right so they started","very late, they said. The musicians have come"]],[2087,["from India – and you’d be amazed that","Australians, Swiss, Germans, English, all"]],[2098,["of them have learned Sanskrit songs and Marathi","songs, which is such a difficult language,"]],[2107,["all these songs – and they have learnt English","songs. It was impossible to teach an Englishman"]],[2116,["one sentence in Hindi. One gentleman asked","Me, “What do you say to the 'close the door'?”"]],[2127,["So My father told him, “You just say 'there","was a banker.' That means ‘you close the"]],[2134,["door’! And for opening the door you say","'there was a cold day.' That’s how you will"]],[2142,["say 'open the door'!” So it was so difficult,","and I’m amazed how through Sahaja Yoga they"]],[2149,["have become so dynamic."]],[2151,["We have got many artists now flowering out.","In your country itself there are so many artists"]],[2158,["who have come out of Sahaja Yoga. They are","very well known here. Also great potters and"]],[2166,["ceramic makers have come out of this. It’s","working on this part, on this area of creativity,"]],[2177,["and lots of musicians have become great musicians","in India. It’s working out in another direction"]],[2186,["in England, that people are writing books","and they have become good orators who would"]],[2192,["never come on the stage. So this is on a worldly","level, we should say, but they themselves"]],[2199,["are so patient and so loving that the happiest","thing I would like to tell you is that twenty-five"]],[2206,["Germans rushed to USSR, to Russia, to help","Me to give realization to Russians. It was"]],[2217,["very touching, really, to see Germans should","feel that innately that it’s their duty"]],[2225,["to give them realization. They spent their","own money coming down there. It’s rather"]],[2232,["difficult to go to Russia because you have","to pay for the hotels beforehand and all that."]],[2237,["They did all that and they were there. It’s","a beautiful that’s happening in the world,"]],[2244,["very beautiful people. And the way they admire","each other and adore, it’s wonderful."]],[2251,["So I would expect you to ask Me some questions.","But the questions should be relevant because"]],[2257,["I’m not here to aggress you, I’m here","just to give you what you have, your own property."]],[2263,["So there’s no need to be aggressive with","Me or to be angry with Me. I’ve not come"]],[2268,["here to take anything from you. So in a sensible","way, whatever you want to ask please ask,"]],[2275,["and we should not waste also time of other","people who are anxious to have their realization."]],[2282,["[Question: Is Mr. Gorbachev realized?]"]],[2288,["Yes, he is very much. Thank God for that!"]],[2299,["[Question: What about Mr. Bush then?]"]],[2307,["Who?"]],[2308,["[Mr. Bush.]"]],[2310,["You can give him realization. You can."]],[2313,["[Question: What for?]"]],[2319,["It’s better not to ask about that. You see,","even Americans don’t understand sometimes"]],[2332,["that if Gorbachev has opted for democracy","he’s not opted for an American style of"]],[2339,["democracy, because American democracy has","not created very good atmosphere. It’s a,"]],[2345,["if you go to America you can’t even wear","a wedding ring. They can kill you even for"]],[2351,["a wedding ring. Such a situation is there.","Horrible!"]],[2355,["And I was going once on a Los Angeles road","and the one who was driving Me told Me that"]],[2361,["“Mother, put down Your head.”"]],[2362,["I said, “Why?”"]],[2363,["And he said, “On this road last week eleven","people were killed.”"]],[2366,["I said, “Why?”"]],[2367,["“For the heck of it.”"]],[2369,["I said, “For the heck of it? So mad?”"]],[2376,["So that democracy has not created a good society,","not good society. They have money, that’s"]],[2384,["all. But money is also not so much well-balanced,","I would say; it doesn’t create good people,"]],[2394,["good children, good families. It should be","the money which is auspicious, which should"]],[2402,["create good atmosphere. And very sick people","there are: certain are very silly also, stupid."]],[2413,["Like eighty-two-year-old people, cinema actors","and actresses, going for a shake dance – they’re"]],[2423,["already shaking! I mean, this I can’t understand.","And they, they want to ride horses at the"]],[2439,["age of ninety-two years of age. And then they","fall down and die. What is the need at ninety-two"]],[2445,["to ride a horse? I mean, there’s no maturity.","If democracy cannot mature you, then it’s"]],[2455,["not nourishing. It must mature; you must become","a wiser person. If you still remain a sixteen-year-old"]],[2463,["brat, what’s the use?"]],[2472,["So it has failed somewhere. As communism has","failed, it has also failed. But Gorbachev"]],[2480,["could see. Mr. Bush has to also see that.","Also the way they are supporting these Azerbaijanis"]],[2488,["– they’re horrible people, these Azerbaijani.","I’ve been there, I’ve been to Samarkand"]],[2493,["and I’ve been to all these places, and they","were rolling in luxuries, rolling in luxuries"]],[2498,["when I went there, thousand time better than","their neighbors Afghanis."]],[2503,["But they said, “We are very miserable because","we can’t follow Islam.”"]],[2509,["But I said, “Why do you want to follow Islam?","What Islam has done good or Christianity has"]],[2514,["done good? Why are you so much anxious to","follow Islam?”"]],[2518,["“No, we must have.”"]],[2520,["And now the Iranians are penetrating that,","and if you support these Azerbaijanis you"]],[2524,["are supporting the Iranians and their fundamentalism.","So there’s no thought given to it. It’s"]],[2532,["not a proper vision; it’s a very blurred","vision. One should see clearly what we are"]],[2540,["doing, who are we helping. There should be","some principle in what we are doing. Imagine,"]],[2551,["Abraham Lincoln who started, who was a realized","soul himself, and how far you have taken him"]],[2560,["there? And there’s only one single road","somewhere in his name. I mean, nobody bothers"]],[2567,["about the principles he established. So something","has gone wrong there. So we must sit back"]],[2573,["and see that what’s wrong with our democracy.","And in all these democratic countries all"]],[2588,["kinds of false gurus have prospered, because","everybody has freedom to give the money to"]],[2594,["whosoever they like."]],[2596,["Yes? These two ladies …. All right, you","ask first."]],[2608,["[Question: She’s been doing yoga for fifteen","years. And she says she has reached all these"]],[2629,["points that You have mentioned, but she is","weak on her left side. Can You help her?]"]],[2637,["Yah. It’s just the outcome of the modern","yoga, absolutely. Actually, Patanjali has"]],[2648,["written such a big book on Hatha Yoga. Nobody","reads that. Only they have taken a wee, wee,"]],[2656,["wee part of it, which is ashtanga, means there","are eight portions out of which one portion"]],[2665,["is yam niyam, out of which it’s one-eighth","of the portion is about exercise, the physical."]],[2675,["But that also is to be used when your kundalini","is rising and you see the defects in your"]],[2684,["spinal cord, or anywhere in your chakras:","then you must know if there is any need for"]],[2692,["a physical correction – all right? But the","way we are doing now Hatha Yoga is like taking"]],[2700,["all the medicines of the medicine box inside,","without any discrimination. So when we pay"]],[2707,["so much attention to the physical side, we","go to the right side and left side is neglected."]],[2712,["There’s an imbalance. And you develop lots","of physical troubles also – physical. Like"]],[2719,["these days jogging is a fashion, so everybody’s","jogging. Everybody wants to be a cinema actress,"]],[2726,["or might be a beauty competition – I don’t","know what they want. And they don’t understand"]],[2732,["that we are human beings, we are delicately","made. Even old people of eighty years are"]],[2738,["jogging, for what? And then they get heart","attacks, serious troubles."]],[2746,["So this kind of a Hatha Yoga weakens your","left side to such an extent that a woman may"]],[2753,["not be able to produce a child, even. Apart","from that, a man who does Hatha Yoga of this"]],[2760,["kind is such a hot-tempered fellow, like an","oven, that you’d better approach that person"]],[2766,["with a barge-pole! God knows when he’ll","jump on you. But in Sahaja Yoga you’ll achieve"]],[2773,["your balance. So don’t, not to do so many","exercises now, discriminately understanding"]],[2780,["which one you want, you have to do – that","much you should do."]],[2786,["Yes. Then there’s one lady here who raised","the hand."]],[2796,["[Question: How can you tell whether you are","acting from intuition or if it's just the"]],[2809,["desire of the moment?]"]],[2812,["You mean you are asking Me or about yourself?"]],[2816,["[Question: In a general sense. How can you","tell the difference?]"]],[2823,["Because you have not reached that state of","Self-realization. In Self-realization if you"]],[2834,["ask a question, any question: say, somebody","says, “I don’t believe in God.” All"]],[2840,["right, ask a question, “Is there God?”","three times, and you get a beautiful wind"]],[2849,["coming on you. “Was Christ the Son of God?”","Ask this question: you get it. Then ask about"]],[2860,["some horrid guru who has been lynching you,","and you will get burns, might get even blisters."]],[2869,["But unless and until you are a realized soul,","you have to – it’s not easy to make it"]],[2875,["out. The only thing, you have to be connected","first of all and to be established. Then you"]],[2883,["reach a state of doubtless awareness, from","the thoughtless awareness. And then you become"]],[2889,["tremendous."]],[2889,["[Sahaja yogi: There’s one right at the back.]"]],[2896,["Anyone."]],[2902,["[Question: Does your realization take place","instantly or does it take place gradually?]"]],[2919,["It takes instantly, My child. It should. Most","of the cases it has to; it’s so spontaneous."]],[2929,["There was a saint called Ramadasa who was","the guru of Shivaji, a great king in India"]],[2934,["– a realized soul, again – and somebody","asked that saint, “How much time does it"]],[2940,["take for the kundalini to rise?”"]],[2943,["And in Sanskrit he said, “Tatkshan” – means","“that moment.” That moment. But there"]],[2948,["has to be the person who gives you realization","authorized by the Divine, and the one who"]],[2957,["is a seeker of truth. I mean, I’m Myself","surprised the way it's happening today, everywhere."]],[2967,["These days it’s really very surprising that","the Divine is so anxious to give you realization."]],[2974,["Many people ask Me, “Mother, why do You","give realization to so many people?”"]],[2979,["I said, “How can I limit it? Now it has","become limitless.”"]],[2983,["Some, like the parable of Christ, fall in","the marshy land and just sprouted and lost"]],[2993,["– I know that. But they’ll come back;","I’m sure they’ll come back. But some do"]],[3001,["prosper very fast and settle down. Imagine","in a place like Russia, I thought this must"]],[3008,["be just wilderness, there I find beautiful","things happening. They, they never talked"]],[3014,["of God, they never talked of religion, they","never talked of spirituality. And openly I"]],[3023,["talked of God and everything; nobody arrested","Me there. Here, we who worship God and who"]],[3033,["have so many churches, who have so many temples","and mosques and all that, you have – I have"]],[3039,["to move like a criminal! Except for their","church or their mosque or their temples, you"]],[3048,["are a cult; while they take all the money,","everything – they are very money-oriented"]],[3053,["and power-oriented also – but you are a","cult! Is very funny."]],[3062,["Yes, please? There’s still the another gentleman","also? …. All right. They need to ask Me"]],[3069,["…."]],[3069,["[Question: Mother, I’ve been trying for","about two months, but I don’t feel any cool"]],[3075,["breeze up here.]"]],[3076,["You feel it in your hands?"]],[3083,["[No, I don’t.]"]],[3085,["All right, we’ll see about it. After the","program – ah, definitely today you’ll"]],[3090,["feel it."]],[3094,["[Question: Where in the seven centers would","You place instinct?]"]],[3103,["You see, “instinct” is a very confusing","word – all right? In the seventh center"]],[3111,["when you arrive, you arrive in the limbic","area. And limbic area has got the seven seats"]],[3118,["of seven centers. So you cannot say that any","particular place is the instinct, but the"]],[3129,["instinct comes from the Divine. So when it","is connected with the Divine, you receive"]],[3139,["it in your brain and it’s transmitted to","your nerves. Also it is transmitted to your"]],[3151,["centers, nourishing it. So you cannot categorize","it."]],[3162,["Yes, what is it? Ask, ask!"]],[3173,["[Question: He finds it very confusing: what","is mind, what is a thought and what is thinking?]"]],[3190,["I think tomorrow I’m going to talk about","thinking. In that I’ll tell you everything"]],[3194,["– all right? Can you keep it for tomorrow,","please? All right? Tomorrow I’ll tell you."]],[3200,["[Question: Got food anything to do with this","process or technique?]"]],[3206,["You see, any kind of food that you eat has","to be suitable for your temperament, your"]],[3212,["prakriti. It has to be suitable. Supposing","you are a very right-sided person, then it’s"]],[3217,["better for you to take more to carbohydrates.","But supposing you are a left-sided person,"]],[3223,["is better for you to take to proteins. There’s","no hard and fast rule about it. It has to"]],[3229,["be complementary to your nature. That’s","how we decide. Every individual has a different"]],[3237,["temperament, and accordingly we have to decide","what sort of food one should take. … May"]],[3250,["God bless."]],[3252,["[Question: Two questions, Shri Mother. One,","are You a vegetarian? And secondly, does the"]],[3263,["soul have a memory?]"]],[3267,["All right. About Me you’d better discover.","You see, I don’t talk about Myself. The"]],[3274,["reason is this: anybody who tried to seek,","say anything about oneself or claim anything,"]],[3282,["people have been very nasty. Christ said,","“I am the Son of God” – which is a fact."]],[3293,["They crucified Him. He didn’t tell a lie.","So I’m very tactful! So you first get your"]],[3305,["realization, because I don’t want to get","crucified just now; I want to postpone it"]],[3311,["as much as possible! So about Me you can find","out, once you get your realization, is better."]],[3320,["What is the second?"]],[3324,["[Question: Does the soul have a memory?]"]],[3328,["Soul has a memory, of course it has. Soul","also is another subject which will take at"]],[3333,["least three, four lectures, and I have given","lectures on that. You can take the tape and"]],[3340,["see for yourself, and after realization you","can see those dead souls also and also you"]],[3347,["can see the Chaitanya, these vibrations, as","small little commas shining. After realization"]],[3355,["you see them. And now there are lots of discoveries","have been made which I’ve said about soul,"]],[3360,["which you can also see from My tapes and can","hear about it. It’s a very long subject."]],[3391,["All right?"]],[3397,["[Question: He has some artificial heart valves","and things in his body, and he wonders if"]],[3410,["a person who has artificial organs can obtain","Self-realization.]"]],[3415,["Of course, you can. Anybody who is living","can get realization. Because, you are living"]],[3424,["because there is spirit within you. The day","spirit disappears from your heart, we are"]],[3437,["no more. On the contrary, your heart condition","will improve, very much. Many people who had"]],[3446,["bypass got rid of it. Many people who had","angina got completely cured. Many heart patients"]],[3455,["were cured completely."]],[3457,["Yes, now, you ask. Now she is asking. … Can","you hear her? Little loudly, can you?"]],[3477,["[Question: Apparently the authors of a lot","of these chakra books say that each chakra"]],[3498,["corresponds to a different …]"]],[3502,["Areas."]],[3502,["[Question continues: ... corroboration of","your soul, of your being. Is that actually"]],[3503,["true? Like as in the chakra here – ]"]],[3504,["Agnya."]],[3505,["[Question continues: Yeah. If, they say that","if that’s opened, you are able to perceive"]],[3512,["things in other beings; like you’re able","to see where they have been and … or you"]],[3513,["are able to use psychic powers and things,","you know? Is that actually true?]"]],[3514,["Yah. Now, this chakra is very important … This","chakra of Agnya which is on the optic chiasma"]],[3518,["is a very important center. It is a very constricted","thing, and the resurrection of Christ has"]],[3528,["solved the problem for us, because He was","resurrected and He's bestowed upon on this"]],[3535,["chakra. He’s the ruling deity of this chakra.","So when kundalini awakens Him on this chakra,"]],[3544,["He sucks in these two balloons, as I told","you: ego and superego. Now the ego and superego"]],[3554,["are controlled by two organs or two things,","what we call as the pituitary and the pineal."]],[3564,["So this center controls pituitary and the","pineal part. Also it is on the optic chiasma."]],[3570,["So you can see things clearly through it.","When it is awakened, you start seeing subtler"]],[3581,["things. But if you see the light, then it’s","not correct. That means you have moved to"]],[3587,["the right, because you see elements on the","right side. You may see also the past: you"]],[3592,["may, you may see Krishna; you may see somebody,","the past. What you have to see, whatever you"]],[3603,["see, you are not that. Supposing I see the","light, I am not the light. So you have to"]],[3608,["be the light. So this movement is deviation","from reality. Either to the right, to the"]],[3616,["left, is not correct and should not be considered","as some achievement, because seeing gives"]],[3624,["you nothing. Being gives you. It is becoming;","you have to become. All right? Now, is there?"]],[3646,["[Question: Are our actions governed by free","will, or is it just fate?]"]],[3653,["It’s free will, absolute free will. You","have come here with your free will, and I"]],[3662,["respect your free will, your freedom. If you","don’t want to have Self-realization, it"]],[3670,["cannot be forced, it cannot be done. It respects","your free will. You can only get it if you"]],[3680,["in free will, in your free glory, you want","to have it. In a way, of course, it does help"]],[3691,["people who live in moderation; but as I told","you, the Divine is so anxious that whatever"]],[3700,["you might have been, you get your realization,","sort of a thing happening today. That’s"]],[3705,["what I’ve seen it. So that’s what you","should expect, and shouldn’t think of your"]],[3713,["past at all. Forget it. Yes?"]],[3717,["[Question: What then of karma?]"]],[3718,["Karma, as I told you, is sucked in when the","kundalini rises through this center. She’s"]],[3726,["sucked in those two institutions. One of them","is of ego. Is the only ego tells us we are"]],[3733,["doing karmas. Animals don’t feel they are","committing sins or doing karmas; only we,"]],[3738,["because we have ego. This ego is sucked in.","So all our karmas are finished. They said"]],[3744,["Christ has died for our sins, and that is","proved. … So far …"]],[3762,["[Question: In regard to reincarnation, do","humans come back as humans?]"]],[3779,["Yes, they do. Some of them do come from animal","stage also, because that we can explain why"]],[3786,["they behave like this!"]],[3788,["[Question: Mother, I’ve been getting very","powerful sensations on this finger here and"]],[3802,["this area here. What is the cause of that","disturbance …?]"]],[3806,["What is the feeling? In the Agnya, here? Here","and here. You are feeling heat?"]],[3811,["[Pain on top of that finger and a small, a","kind of heat and pain there …]"]],[3820,["Here? All right. You don’t worry about the","cause. We’ll correct it. All right? It’s,"]],[3832,["it’s better not to know about it. It’s","nothing serious but still … You see, this"]],[3837,["may be that – what is your job?"]],[3839,["[I don’t have a job. I was in an auto accident","last year and I’ve been incapacitated since.]"]],[3848,["Incapacitated?"]],[3848,["[Yes.]"]],[3849,["How?"]],[3849,["[Injuries to both legs and right up to my","abdomen, right up to my chest.]"]],[3858,["What he said?"]],[3858,["[Sahaja yogi: He's had severe injuries to","both legs and his torso up to his chest.]"]],[3859,["And on your left hand, what are you feeling?"]],[3859,["[A lot of pain in that finger there and a","pain just here which is in line with the third"]],[3864,["finger.]"]],[3864,["All of them?"]],[3864,["[Sahaja yogi: The right Vishuddhi, Shri Mother","…]"]],[3871,["[And this one here.]"]],[3878,["All right. So this is, this is definitely","connected with your body and that has to be"]],[3887,["corrected, that’s all. All right? Then you","won’t feel anything."]],[3893,["[Question: Why do we take on the physical","state?]"]],[3904,["You cannot get realization without it, My","child. You cannot get","it in the air!"]],[3924,["[Question: He said, if realization is the","dropping away of habits, isn’t riding a"]],[3944,["horse at ninety-five just a matter of habit?]"]],[3947,["No, no, no, no, no! You didn’t understand.","No, what happens, you become a very powerful"]],[3954,["personality. And you become an enlightened","personality. So you drop out whatever is bad"]],[3960,["for you, that’s all."]],[3964,["[Question: Is horse-riding necessarily bad?]"]],[3967,["Anything that is not good for you, you understand","and nobody has to tell you. You become your"]],[3972,["own master, you become your own guru and you","drop it. I don’t have to tell you “don’t"]],[3977,["do this” or “don’t do that” – you","just do it yourself. Isn’t it better for"]],[3981,["Me? (Now, so many questions; it’s ten o’clock","about, yes?)"]],[3994,["[Unclear question]"]],[3997,["What did he say? Did you follow him?"]],[4005,["[Sahaja yogi: I don’t think I got that one.","…. I think he said, if You promote the idea"]],[4036,["of jumping into the divine flow of vibrations","and want to clear ourselves, once upon a time"]],[4043,["we jumped into the river to get clean but","now the river is polluted. Are there dangers"]],[4048,["in jumping into the spirit?]"]],[4051,["No, no, not at all dangerous – it’s wonderful!","No, no, not at all dangerous: that’s a myth."]],[4060,["That’s a myth about kundalini. It’s such","a myth they have created because they never"]],[4065,["wanted you to get your realization, so that","they could make money out of you, you see."]],[4070,["They don’t want you to go to reality. So","then, they can use you. That’s the reason"]],[4075,["they said all these things. It has no meaning.","We have now been working in so many places,"]],[4079,["I’ve never seen. At the most some people,","like this lady who was here was sick, was"]],[4086,["shaking her hand, and then she put it to her","Mother Earth and she was sitting before Me,"]],[4092,["and she got all right. So her shaking stopped.","It was Parkinson’s. Just sitting here; she’s"]],[4098,["gone now."]],[4098,["[Question: What is the flame, Shri Mother","‒ the spirit? What is the flame? …. On"]],[4098,["the chart.]"]],[4103,["Where is the flame?"]],[4111,["[Sahaja yogi: On the left Heart.]"]],[4118,["On the left Heart is the spirit. Is the spirit.","It’s difficult to show spirit, you see,"]],[4128,["so they have shown it as a flame."]],[4138,["[Question: Do dreams have a part in one's","spirit?]"]],[4146,["They come from different areas. They don’t","only come from collective subconscious, they"]],[4152,["come also from the subconscious that you have","had in past lives, maybe in this life; could"]],[4158,["be from just from yesterday. So it depends","on from what area it comes. But it’s not"]],[4165,["important. Once you know the real truth, then","you don’t bother about these things; because"]],[4169,["the communication is not circuitous, it’s","just direct, so you know the truth. So you’re"]],[4175,["not interested to know any more."]],[4179,["[Question: Is there","a place for sorrow in someone who is self-realized?]"]],[4194,["No, no, not at all. It’s such a joy. You","see, sorrow comes through our ignorance. Also"]],[4206,["they want to, you to feel sorry for everything,","you know. Like the way they show Christ like"]],[4213,["a skeleton, you see, naturally you feel sorry;","but only Michelangelo could see clearly that"]],[4220,["it was a great Personality. So he painted","Him like a great giant in the, you see Him"]],[4228,["in the Sistine Chapel. But below on the table","they have placed a skeleton of Christ which"]],[4237,["is, creates such horrible feelings within","yourself. I think we should ask one of these"]],[4244,["priests to carry one, the cross across and","see if they can do it with their skeleton"]],[4251,["bodies."]],[4252,["So sorrow is also created. Also, people like","to show they are sorry. Like this Greek tragedy"]],[4261,["has no sense in it; just make it Greek tragedy,","unnecessarily. I mean, one gentleman falls"]],[4272,["in love: he falls, doesn’t rise, falls in","love! And then he doesn’t marry that person;"]],[4280,["then he is pining. I mean, human life is worth","much more, not to pine after one lady. Then"]],[4289,["in next year he marries that lady. I mean","this is the – you see, everything must have"]],[4295,["an antithesis also. So then he marries the","same lady, and then he wants to get rid of"]],[4301,["her somehow. And then he murders her out of","frustration. This should be the story, because"]],[4308,["this kind of wasteful habits of human beings","leading nowhere. You cannot get joy from another"]],[4316,["person: joy is your own property. This comes","from your own spirit. It doesn’t depend"]],[4324,["on another person. Only a realized soul can","enjoy another realized soul. Only you understand"]],[4334,["the value of another person when you are a","realized soul, and another person is also"]],[4339,["a realized soul; otherwise you cannot. Yes?"]],[4345,["[Unclear question]"]],[4349,["You see, Gorbachev has solved one problem,","a little bit. Because these are two superior"]],[4367,["powers, you see: super-most, we can call,","superpowers. So the, you need two hands to"]],[4374,["clap. So one hand has receded. Now this hand","doesn’t know what to do, what to hit, so"]],[4380,["it has to recede also. So in a way, the pressure","of war he has lessened, and he is going to"]],[4389,["lessen more. But I think today the world problem","is, if you see internationally, is fundamentalism."]],[4399,["Is fundamentalism. And those who try to encourage","fundamentalism are really committing sins"]],[4405,["against humanity, I think. So fundamentalism","I find as the biggest problem, and to answer"]],[4413,["to this is Sahaja Yoga."]],[4415,["Then our social problems come because we don’t","understand the role of a woman and the role"]],[4419,["of a man; and when we don’t respect women","for their great role they are playing, they"]],[4425,["become something funny. So all this understanding","comes to you very beautifully when you become"]],[4433,["a self-realized person. Another problem is","ecological problem, comes out of our own imbalances."]],[4440,["Whatever is inside, we manifest outside. You","see, there’s so much imbalance in us."]],[4448,["Like in, when we were in India I never allowed","any drinks in My house. I said, “All right,"]],[4454,["if you want to drink, drink in your house","and come to My house.” But I can’t understand"]],[4459,["a person who is drunk. God knows, he might","just get up and slap Me or do anything! But"]],[4467,["when we went to London, they, they said we","have to offer them. I said, “All right.”"]],[4473,["I told My husband, “You arrange all that.","Do it yourself.” That time ‒ it’s long"]],[4479,["time back I’m telling you ‒ just to buy","crystal tumblers for an ordinary party we"]],[4488,["had to shell out nine hundred pounds, to begin","with. That’s the beginning of the library."]],[4497,["And so many were to be added later on. There","is one cup for this and a one cup for that"]],[4502,["– I mean, a one cup is sufficient. And one","tumbler for that and this – big, it’s"]],[4512,["a big science, you know ‒ books after books.","I told My husband, “You’d better get it"]],[4520,["and read it.” Then we hired three, four","people. I said, “Baba, you look after these"]],[4526,["people.” Somebody wants this, somebody wants","that, and it’s a very big sort of a social"]],[4532,["nonsensical wastage."]],[4533,["So these things we have created. Then, fork","and spoon, you start from here, go on like"]],[4543,["that; and then go on that way. There’s no","need to do all that. And I understand, if"]],[4552,["it was something artistic, all right, some","artists are doing. But these days there’s"]],[4557,["no art: it’s so simple, there’s no art","in it. If there’s even one flower they don’t"]],[4562,["like it – this is too much. No art anywhere,","no Limoges, it’s just straightforward march."]],[4571,["So all this creation is all useless rubbish","which will form another plastic mountain."]],[4580,["So this ecological problem has come because","we have no sense of balance and discretion."]],[4587,["Just go to the shopping: the husband gives","the money to the wife to buy some shirts and"]],[4591,["she comes out with some three, four funny","punk dresses which will be discarded after"]],[4601,["three, four months. We play into the hands","of entrepreneurs all the time. Entrepreneurs"]],[4607,["start some sort of a funny dress: all right,","everybody must dress up like that. We have"]],[4612,["our own intelligence, we have our own personality!","We have no individuality left; everybody must"]],[4618,["dress up the same way."]],[4619,["Now, I should say that we must put some oil","in our head at least the day we want to wash"]],[4626,["our hair, because we’ll all become bald","and then these entrepreneurs will sell us"]],[4633,["the wigs. That’s the trick! So now the fashion","is not to put oil – all right, don’t put"]],[4639,["oil; but at least before washing your hair","you can put some oil in your head. You see,"]],[4645,["this is what I am saying: the wisdom part","is not there and the balance is not there,"]],[4649,["and because of that we are getting into trouble.","All kinds of venturesome things have started,"]],[4657,["like the Grand Prix. Now, the man must die","in the Grand Prix, otherwise it’s not a"]],[4664,["good one – that’s what they say, exactly."]],[4668,["So this sensationalisation – must have sensations,","as if we have become numbed people: absolutely"]],[4673,["we have no sensitivity to feel any joy or","happiness, so we have to be given injections"]],[4678,["all the time, like electric shocks. To Me","all these things, this looks so shocking."]],[4685,["And I’ll tell you tomorrow what happens","to you when you get into all these shocks."]],[4689,["This is what happens, that you develop blood","cancer. Cancer is created by us, by our imbalance,"]],[4699,["by our insanity. We have to become sane people.","We must respect ourselves. Perhaps we have"]],[4709,["had no identity so far, that’s why we are","like this. But once you are realized, you"]],[4714,["know your identity and then you enjoy yourself,","you respect yourself. And don’t waste your"]],[4723,["time in useless things, destroying yourself."]],[4726,["Yes? I, I tell you now, you see, the time","is coming up much more, so one question will"]],[4735,["do. Now who will withdraw? …. All right,","one lady waiting. Who is that one? This one?"]],[4758,["…. What is it? …. What?"]],[4760,["[Question: The spirit. Does the spirit discriminate","between good and evil, love and hate, or does"]],[4770,["it just react?]"]],[4771,["Spirit is the source of knowledge, absolute","knowledge; is the source of peace, is the"]],[4784,["source of wisdom, is the source of joy, is","the source that enlightens our attention."]],[4799,["We have such a big property with us. We should","allow it to enlighten us, shouldn’t we?"]],[4809,["Now I think we should stop the questions,","because there’s one thing: I’m quite good"]],[4817,["at answering questions. I’ll answer all","your questions, but by that I cannot guarantee"]],[4826,["your realization. I can answer most of your","questions, but I can’t guarantee your realization."]],[4832,["Realization has to work out. So even if you","have not been able to ask some question, forget"]],[4838,["it. You can bring them tomorrow written down,","and I would like to answer them when you come"]],[4846,["tomorrow. Beforehand if you give, I’ll answer","them. But just now I think, tell your mind"]],[4851,["not to bother you any more about questions.","And that’s why I wanted you to ask questions,"]],[4855,["so that your mind should not suddenly come","out like jack-in-the-box and say, “Oh, you"]],[4860,["didn’t ask this question. How can you have","realization?” So the most important thing"]],[4868,["is to get your realization."]],[4873,["So I think, let us have it now. Again, I cannot","force on you. You have to have it in your"]],[4881,["free will. So please, those who want to have","should be there. It will take hardly ten minutes"]],[4889,["to work it out, and then tomorrow again I’m","going to work it out. It’s very simple,"]],[4898,["very easy. But those who don’t want to have","it should not be in the hall. It’s not proper,"]],[4904,["it’s not civil. So all those who want to","have it, are welcome."]],[4910,["At the very outset, at the very outset there","are two conditions I have to tell you. First"]],[4929,["one, as I told you before also, you have to","forget the past. You have to forgive yourself,"]],[4938,["and know that you are not guilty at all. All","these ideas are given to you that you are"]],[4945,["sinful, you are guilty, you are this and that","because they wanted to cash it. You don’t"]],[4954,["have to suffer either. So first of all you","should know that you must forgive yourself"]],[4964,["and must have self-esteem and you should be","very pleasantly placed towards yourself, because"]],[4970,["you are going to enter into the Kingdom of","God. This is the first condition."]],[4979,["Now the second condition is that you have","to forgive everyone. Some will say it’s"]],[4988,["very difficult to forgive. But whether you","forgive or don’t forgive, you don’t do"]],[4996,["anything. It’s a myth. But if you don’t","forgive then you really play into the hands"]],[5003,["of the people who want to torture you. So","best is to forgive them, forget about them."]],[5008,["Forgive and forget. But don’t start counting","how many people I have to forgive, what mistakes"]],[5014,["they have done – nothing of the kind. Just","in general say “I forgive everyone” – just,"]],[5020,["and it’s done. Because Divine is the ocean","of forgiveness, it’s a very powerful ocean"]],[5026,["of forgiveness, and you cannot do anything","that it cannot forgive. And once you say “I"]],[5033,["forgive,” Divine takes over; we don’t","have to bother. All right? These are the two"]],[5042,["conditions we have; very simple conditions,","I think. We have to take out our shoes to"]],[5048,["take the help of the Mother Earth. That’s","very important."]],[5061,["(It’s supposed to be .… Too much for the","throat, talking all the time. All right.)"]],[5098,["Now …. (It’s all right.) You have to put","both your feet apart from each other, because"]],[5108,["as I told you there are two powers. A little","apart from each other, not touching. And you"]],[5112,["have to be comfortable. If there’s something","tight you can release it a little bit. You"]],[5118,["need not bend down or stretch yourself too","much. Just in a normal way you sit down. Put"]],[5125,["no strain on your body. You have to put your","left hand towards Me like this, in a comfortable"]],[5134,["way, on your – you can keep it on your lap,","whatever is comfortable. Now this represents"]],[5143,["that you desire to have your realization.","So you keep it all the time like this. And"]],[5149,["with the right hand we’ll nourish our centers.","With the right hand we will nourish our centers."]],[5158,["And so you will know also how to raise your","kundalini yourself. So two things can be done:"]],[5164,["your kundalini will be raised; as well as","you will feel, you will know how to feel your"]],[5173,["centers within yourself and how to correct","them. We’ll be working only on the left-hand"]],[5179,["side. So now you have to put the left hand","towards Me. First I’ll show you, he will"]],[5187,["show you what is to be done, and then you’ll","have to close your eyes later on."]],[5198,["First we’ll put our hand on our heart. In","the heart resides the spirit. Then we’ll"]],[5213,["have to put our hand on the upper portion","of our abdomen, on the left-hand side. This"]],[5222,["is the center of your mastery, created by","great masters. Then you have to take your"]],[5231,["right hand in the lower portion of your abdomen","on the left-hand side, which is a very important"]],[5236,["center which manifests this pure knowledge","on your central nervous system. Then you have"]],[5253,["to raise your hand higher, again on to the","left side of your abdomen, on the upper part."]],[5262,["Press it hard, on the center of mastery. Then","to your heart again. And then on to the corner"]],[5277,["between your neck and your shoulder – from","the front side, not from the back but from"]],[5282,["the front side – and turn your head to your","right. Now this center is very important,"]],[5288,["because this catches on very much, specially","in the West, because people all the time feel"]],[5295,["guilty. And because of this people get spondylitis","and angina and all other lethargic organs"]],[5303,["diseases. So please put your hand here, as","far back as possible, and turn your head to"]],[5312,["your right."]],[5313,["Now, take your right hand and put it on your","forehead across and try to put your head down"]],[5324,["slowly, resting on this hand. And now press","it on both the sides, as we do it when we"]],[5337,["have headache. This is the center for forgiving","others. Then you have to take down your hand,"]],[5346,["take up your hand onto the back side of your","head where the optic lobe is, here at the"]],[5351,["back. And now turn your head upward as far","as possible, resting on your hand. This is"]],[5361,["the center where you have to ask for forgiveness","from the Divine without feeling guilty – is"]],[5367,["for your satisfaction. Now, stretch your hand,","stretch your palm and put the center of your"]],[5377,["palm just on top of the fontanel bone area,","which was the soft bone in your childhood."]],[5385,["And now bend your head, please, downward as","much as possible. Push back your fingers,"]],[5395,["push back as much as possible. Now there will","be a pressure on the scalp. Now move this"]],[5403,["pressure on the scalp slowly clockwise, seven","times. You have to move the scalp, not your"]],[5410,["hand so much as the scalp, seven times clockwise,","slowly. Bend your head."]],[5420,["That’s what we’ll have to do. That’s","all, nothing more. That’s the only thing"]],[5433,["we have to do. Now, you can take out your","spectacles if you want because you’re closing"]],[5440,["your eyes, and might help your eyesight also."]],[5446,["Now, put your left hand towards Me, comfortably.","Put your feet apart from each other. And now"]],[5456,["put your right hand on your heart and close","your eyes. Here you have to ask Me a very"]],[5472,["important question, in your heart. You ask","Me a question as you would ask a computer."]],[5479,["You can call Me “Shri Mataji” or “Mother”,","whatever you like. “Mother, am I the spirit?”"]],[5489,["Ask the question, in your heart, not loudly.","Three times ask in your heart, not loudly,"]],[5495,["“Mother, am I the spirit?” You have to","only ask in your heart."]],[5512,["If you are the spirit you become your own","guide, you become your own master, you become"]],[5518,["your own guru. So now take down your right","hand into the upper portion of your abdomen"]],[5528,["on the left-hand side. And here you have to","ask another question, three times, not loudly,"]],[5542,["in your heart, “Mother, am I the spirit?”","– ah! “Mother, am I my own master? Mother,"]],[5550,["am I my own master?” Ask this question three","times. “Am I my own master?”"]],[5575,["I have told you that I respect your freedom,","and the pure knowledge cannot be forced on"]],[5588,["you. So please take your right hand in the","lower portion of your abdomen, and say it"]],[5600,["six times, asking Me, “Mother, please give","me pure knowledge.” I cannot force on you."]],[5610,["You have to ask in your free will."]],[5620,["As soon as you ask for the pure knowledge,","the kundalini starts moving upward."]],[5640,["So now we have to nourish the higher centers","with our self-confidence. Raise your right"]],[5654,["hand in the upper portion of your abdomen.","Press it hard, on the left-hand side. And"]],[5667,["here with full confidence you have to say","ten times, in your heart, not loudly, “Mother,"]],[5676,["I am my own master.” Please say this ten","times, “Mother, I am my own master.”"]],[5705,["I told you at the very outset that the greatest","truth about you is that you are not this body,"]],[5712,["you are not this mind, you are not these conditionings,","emotions, nor this ego, but you are the spirit."]],[5722,["You are the pure spirit. So now raise your","right hand onto your heart and ask here, or"]],[5743,["say with full confidence, twelve times, “Mother,","I am the spirit.” Just say it without any"]],[5755,["hesitation. Say it twelve times, please."]],[5772,["For your information you have to know that","the divine Power is the source of knowledge,"]],[5789,["is the ocean of knowledge, is the ocean of","love. It is the ocean of peace and ocean of"]],[5803,["bliss. But above all it is the ocean of forgiveness.","So you cannot commit any mistake which cannot"]],[5812,["be dissolved by the power of this ocean of","forgiveness. So please raise your right hand"]],[5820,["in the corner of your neck, on your shoulder,","push it back as much as possible and turn"]],[5829,["your head to your right, and with full confidence","please say sixteen times, full confidence,"]],[5840,["in your heart, “Mother, I am not guilty","at all.”"]],[5858,["All right. As I told you before that you have","to forgive everyone, and those who say it"]],[5876,["is difficult, they must know that it is a","myth whether you forgive or don’t forgive."]],[5882,["But if you don’t forgive then you play into","the wrong hands and get yourself tortured"]],[5889,["by yourself. So please forgive – in general,","everyone, not counting how many people you"]],[5896,["have to forgive, what you have to forgive","– but just say, by raising your hand and"]],[5902,["putting it on top of your forehead across,","putting down your head as much as possible,"]],[5910,["resting on your hand. Please say, with an","open heart please say, “Mother, I forgive"]],[5924,["everyone.” Please say it, please say; otherwise","it is difficult later on for Me: I have to"]],[5938,["clear out everybody’s Agnya and this takes","too much time then. So best is to say it from"]],[5944,["your heart. After all, you are not going to","miss your Self-realization for that."]],[5954,["Now take back your right hand on the back","side of your head, and put your head on it,"]],[5965,["resting on it, upward. Here you have to say","for your own satisfaction, “Oh Divine, if"]],[5976,["I have done any mistakes, please forgive me.”","But don’t feel guilty, don’t count your"]],[5982,["mistakes, don’t think about them. In general","you have to say, “Oh Divine, please forgive"]],[5987,["me if I have done any mistakes or anything","wrong, anything against You.”"]],[5999,["Now, stretch your palm, stretch your palm","and put the center of your palm on top of"]],[6008,["the fontanel bone area which was a soft bone","in your childhood. Now put down your head"]],[6016,["properly. And here push back your fingers","as far as possible. Please push back. This"]],[6027,["is very important. And now put a pressure","on your scalp, and move your scalp slowly"]],[6034,["seven times clockwise. Here again I respect","your freedom, and I cannot force Self-realization"]],[6045,["on you. So here you have to say seven times,","bending your head properly and pressing it"]],[6052,["hard, moving seven times, “Mother, please","give me my Self-realization.” Please ask"]],[6059,["seven times, please."]],[6061,["[Shri Mataji blows into the microphone.]"]],[6089,["Now, take down your hands and put them towards","Me, little higher. Now, little bit put your"]],[6128,["right hand like this. Bend your head, and","see for yourself if there is a cool breeze"]],[6135,["coming out of your head. But don’t touch","it – above your head, above your head. And"]],[6144,["some people get it far. So just try to feel","if there’s a cool breeze coming out of your"]],[6151,["head. Now, don’t start doubting that it’s","air-conditioning and all that – air-conditioning"]],[6158,["cannot come out of your head! So see for yourself.","Now, put","your left hand towards Me. Now again bend"]],[6175,["your head, and see for yourself if there’s","a cool breeze coming out of your head. All"]],[6190,["right? Now put your right hand again, and","again bend your head and see for yourself"]],[6199,["if there’s a cool breeze coming out of your","head. It might be hot also, doesn’t matter."]],[6205,["It may be heat coming out first and then the","cool breeze. Doesn’t matter if it is hot,"]],[6212,["doesn’t matter."]],[6214,["Now, put your both the hands towards the sky","like this. Bend back, and ask Me a question."]],[6226,["Three times, you can ask Me the question,","“Mother, is this the cool breeze of the"]],[6232,["Holy Ghost? Mother, is this the all-pervading","Power of divine love? Mother, is this the"]],[6242,["Paramachaitanya?” Ask any one of these questions","three times."]],[6255,["Now put down your hands. Now watch Me without","thinking. You can do it. Those who have felt"]],[6270,["the cool breeze in their hands or out of their","fontanel bone area, whether cool or hot, please"]],[6279,["raise both your hands – both. Let’s see.","Just see the en masse, just see – wonderful!"]],[6290,["So may God bless you all."]],[6294,["I bow to you all, because you have started","now your saintly life. And all those who didn’t"]],[6301,["get also should not get disappointed. On the","contrary, if time permits I would like to"]],[6309,["meet the people who have felt the cool breeze,","and those who haven’t felt can come on this"]],[6314,["side and the Sahaja yogis can work on them.","Again tomorrow you must come so you’ll be"]],[6320,["fixed properly. Some, those who want to meet","Me can come and see Me, because there is some"]],[6325,["time, and in the meanwhile we can have some","music. Now don’t think about it. If you"]],[6335,["start thinking, you’ll be lost. Just don’t","think about it; it’s beyond thinking."]],[6340,["Thank you very much. Thank you. Beautiful!","Oh, My! Thank you. It’s beautiful flowers."]],[6346,["If you can push this apart, I’d like to","meet people."]],[6351,["[Bhajans]"]]]);
